        "body": "Bumps [@agentclientprotocol/sdk](https://github.com/agentclientprotocol/typescript-sdk) from 0.28.1 to 1.1.0.\n<details>\n<summary>Release notes</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a href=\"https://github.com/agentclientprotocol/typescript-sdk/releases\">@​agentclientprotocol/sdk's releases</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>v1.1.0</h2>\n<h2><a href=\"https://github.com/agentclientprotocol/typescript-sdk/compare/v1.0.0...v1.1.0\">1.1.0</a> (2026-06-29)</h2>\n<h3>Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Expose request ids in handler contexts (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/agentclientprotocol/typescript-sdk/issues/202\">#202</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/agentclientprotocol/typescript-sdk/commit/eda849ca7894f32e4ed11df81eb5b024e5512e5b\">eda849c</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>v1.0.0</h2>\n<h2><a href=\"https://github.com/agentclientprotocol/typescript-sdk/compare/v0.29.0...v1.0.0\">1.0.0</a> (2026-06-24)</h2>\n<h3>Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>schema:</strong> Update to v1.16.0 of the schema (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/agentclientprotocol/typescript-sdk/issues/199\">#199</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/agentclientprotocol/typescript-sdk/commit/de5879100c1bb5e2fdaebc957c1ca01364eb33cc\">de58791</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Miscellaneous Chores</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>release 1.0.0 (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/agentclientprotocol/typescript-sdk/issues/201\">#201</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/agentclientprotocol/typescript-sdk/commit/008fc2861adc3f87edc4daa12eb78b81a6fd7161\">008fc28</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>v0.29.0</h2>\n<h2><a href=\"https://github.com/agentclientprotocol/typescript-sdk/compare/v0.28.1...v0.29.0\">0.29.0</a> (2026-06-22)</h2>\n<h3>Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>unstable:</strong> Add support for request cancellation (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/agentclientprotocol/typescript-sdk/issues/195\">#195</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/agentclientprotocol/typescript-sdk/commit/d5197f9f6346a4b57084552e0bdf3c71ccf64412\">d5197f9</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n</blockquote>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Changelog</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a href=\"https://github.com/agentclientprotocol/typescript-sdk/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md\">@​agentclientprotocol/sdk's changelog</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2><a href=\"https://github.com/agentclientprotocol/typescript-sdk/compare/v1.0.0...v1.1.0\">1.1.0</a> (2026-06-29)</h2>\n<h3>Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Expose request ids in handler contexts (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/agentclientprotocol/typescript-sdk/issues/202\">#202</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/agentclientprotocol/typescript-sdk/commit/eda849ca7894f32e4ed11df81eb5b024e5512e5b\">eda849c</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><a href=\"https://github.com/agentclientprotocol/typescript-sdk/compare/v0.29.0...v1.0.0\">1.0.0</a> (2026-06-24)</h2>\n<h3>Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>schema:</strong> Update to v1.16.0 of the schema (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/agentclientprotocol/typescript-sdk/issues/199\">#199</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/agentclientprotocol/typescript-sdk/commit/de5879100c1bb5e2fdaebc957c1ca01364eb33cc\">de58791</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Miscellaneous Chores</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>release 1.0.0 (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/agentclientprotocol/typescript-sdk/issues/201\">#201</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/agentclientprotocol/typescript-sdk/commit/008fc2861adc3f87edc4daa12eb78b81a6fd7161\">008fc28</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><a href=\"https://github.com/agentclientprotocol/typescript-sdk/compare/v0.28.1...v0.29.0\">0.29.0</a> (2026-06-22)</h2>\n<h3>Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>unstable:</strong> Add support for request cancellation (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/agentclientprotocol/typescript-sdk/issues/195\">#195</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/agentclientprotocol/typescript-sdk/commit/d5197f9f6346a4b57084552e0bdf3c71ccf64412\">d5197f9</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n</blockquote>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/agentclient